error[E0578]: conformance declared by a module
 --> $DIR/user-module.nra:4:22
  |
4 | let Numbers = module implements Additive<int> (
  |                      ^^^^^^^^^^ only a primitive's companion in the standard library declares 'implements'
  |
  = note: a class conforms to an interface by listing it after 'implements'; a primitive conforms only through its companion
  = help: declare a class that implements the interface

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0578`.
